==Items==
* [[Corpse item]]s can be obtained as a reward from [[Ritual]]s. They can be used to create a Spectral Corpse. However, these monsters will not be added to the player's spectre pool, preventing the player from spawning their corpses.

===Unique items===
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables = item_stats
|join = item_stats._pageName=items._pageName
|where = 
    (
        (items.stat_text LIKE "%corpse%" AND items.stat_text NOT LIKE "%added passive%")
        OR items.name IN ("Veruso's Ambition", "The Queen's Hunger", "The Devouring Diadem")
    )
AND items.name NOT IN ("Megalomaniac")
|level=1
|stat=1
|large=1
}}

