==Version history==
{{Version history table header}}
{{Version history table row|3.25.0|
* [[Corpse]]s spawned by the [[Desecrate]] and [[Corpse Walk]] skills now have a flat 15% chance to match your spectres, rather than a 15% chance on top of being added to the main pool of corpse varieties that can be picked from. These [[Spectral Corpse]]s are now unusable for most purposes, and can only be used by [[Minion]] Skills such as {{il|Raise Spectre}} or {{il|Bone Offering}}.
** Spectral Corpses have a visual effect applied to them to help differentiate them from other corpses.
** Spectral Corpses can only spawn if you have the Raise Spectre Skill.
* [[Corpse item|Itemised Corpses]] now spawn Spectral Corpses.
* Player-spawned Corpses are no longer affected by modifiers on Maps.
}}
{{Version history table row|3.24.0|
